Subject: CPMS I02 Activation Semantic Refinement

@ [refinement_uuid] b18f1f5a-b0cb-4c03-a328-55b0c5c516c8

& [Capability] means compile-time schema description only
  + derive capability implements JsonSchema for the exact reachable transport closure
  + it does not generate, publish, validate, retrieve, accept, admit, or execute a schema

& [Optional] means default behavior is structurally unchanged
  + default features are empty
  + existing dependents do not enable json-schema
  + only an explicit feature build compiles the dependency and derive implementations

& [Inventory] means exact names and exact source ownership
  + no private helper or unrelated public form enters by convenience
  + failure to compile a root expands the reviewed inventory explicitly rather than silently

& [Activation] means I02A only
  + later generator and document slices remain inactive despite sharing the CPMS-I02 family name

